      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "On a project, 🎙 Meet joins your meeting: the assistant hears the meeting app, speaks through a virtual microphone, and looks up the project's conversations, pull\nrequests, findings and issues. It only reads: it never starts, messages, merges or closes anything.",
      "originalText": "On a project, 🎙 Meet joins your meeting: the assistant hears the meeting app, speaks through a virtual microphone, and looks up the project's conversations, pull\nrequests, findings and issues. It only reads: it never starts, messages, merges or closes anything.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
