      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Keep omits secrets from the save. Replace sends the whole set as a JSON object, including unchanged entries. Clear sends an empty object. An Authorization header\nbypasses OAuth. Switching transport removes the other transport's secrets on core.",
